## Tidy arranges by barycenter cell ordering (2026-10-17)

- [x] Lane×column cell orders come from barycenter sweeps over wired
      neighbors; y is row pitch plus an order-preserving median polish.
      Lane membership, grants, drop acceptance, and the layering laws
      are untouched.

## Tidy compactness and loop pairing (2026-10-17)

- [x] Columns span their widest card plus air (floored); lane rows
      pitch to the lane tallest card, floored at the resting row; a
      mutual pair shares one column; weakly connected components pack
      side by side; polish medians stay same-lane.
      Lane membership, grants, drop acceptance, and the acyclic LTR law
      are untouched.
